{"articleNo":"56043","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=56043&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2012년 여름계절수업 원스톱 정원외 수강신청 방법 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2012.05.30","hit":"8904","attachments":[{"name":"수강신청서 담당교수서명 문의처 안내.xlsx","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=56043&attachNo=1312"},{"name":"수강 신청서(2012).hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=56043&attachNo=1314"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>&nbsp;</p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; COLOR: #009966; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: 'HY헤드라인M'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt\">2012 여름 계절수업</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; COLOR: #009966; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: 'HY헤드라인M'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt\">수강신청 정원외 개별 추가신청 안내</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: 'HY헤드라인M'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 83.5pt; TEXT-INDENT: -83.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">1. 신청 대상 : 원스톱서비스에 신청정원이 마감된 강좌</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 83.5pt; TEXT-INDENT: -83.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.8pt\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.8pt; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">※ 수강불가 대상 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.8pt\">: </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.8pt\">2012-1 동일과목 수강중인 학생 및 휴학생</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 83.5pt; TEXT-INDENT: -83.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt\">2. 허용 범위 : 과목별 담당교수의 허가가 있는 경우에는 신청 가능</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 83.5pt; TEXT-INDENT: -83.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt\">3. 허용 기간 : 수강신청기간내 교무처로 제출자에 한정</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 83.5pt; TEXT-INDENT: -83.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt\">(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt\">2012. 5. 30(수) ~ 6. 04(월) 18:00까지, 4일간)</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 83.5pt; TEXT-INDENT: -83.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt\">4. 신청 절차 : 수강신청서 양식 작성 ⇒ 담당교수 서명</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 83.5pt; TEXT-INDENT: -83.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;⇒ 교무처 제출(본관 201호)</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 83.5pt; TEXT-INDENT: -83.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt\">4. 수강과목수 : 2과목 6학점 이내</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 83.5pt; TEXT-INDENT: -83.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt\">5. 수강신청서 양식 : 첨부참조</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 83.5pt; TEXT-INDENT: -83.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\">&nbsp;</p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt\"><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; COLOR: #009966; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: 'HY헤드라인M'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt\">담당교수 수강신청서 서명 절차 안내</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; COLOR: #009966; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: 'HY헤드라인M'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt\"></span>&nbsp;</p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; COLOR: #009966; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: 'HY헤드라인M'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">1. 절차 : 수강신청서양식 작성(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span>교무처비치, 첨부파일다운로드) - 담당교수 서명 -</span></span></font></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; COLOR: #009966; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: 'HY헤드라인M'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;교무처 제출(본관201호)</span></span></font></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; COLOR: #009966; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: 'HY헤드라인M'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">2. 담당교수 서명 : 해당 학부(과)별 종합학사행정실 문의(담당교수 위치)</span></font></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; COLOR: #009966; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: 'HY헤드라인M'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; : 첨부 참조&nbsp;</span></font></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; COLOR: #009966; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: 'HY헤드라인M'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt\"></span>&nbsp;</p></span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
